;; Seed Genome evolution policy (component).
;;
;; The evolution module consumed by the Milestone 7+ evolution
;; subsystem. :max-risk :behavioral bounds the mutation risk class the
;; seed generation may evolve under (R1 :behavioral is the ceiling —
;; parameter-level mutations are the only safer class). Kept
;; schema-valid against the v1 EvolutionPolicySchema shape
;; (evoclj.genome.schema) even though no evolution code exists yet.
{:evolution {:max-risk :behavioral
             :mutable #{:parameters :prompts :skills :programs}}}
